#: src/routes/zosia/+page.svelte
msgid "Winter Camp of Computer Science Students (ZOSIA) is an event organized by the Computer Science Students' Association for over 20 years. The history of the camp began with informal trips of a group of friends; today, it brings together nearly 300 people every year: students from various universities, representatives of academia, and IT companies."
msgstr "Winter Camp of Computer Science Students (ZOSIA) is an event organized by the Computer Science Students' Association for over 20 years. The history of the camp began with informal trips of a group of friends; today, it brings together nearly 300 people every year: students from various universities, representatives of academia, and IT companies."

#: src/routes/zosia/+page.svelte
msgid "During the three-day trip, there are lectures, company presentations, as well as excursions and integration parties. ZOSIA traditionally takes place at the turn of February and March, sharing a passion for technology in a unique winter atmosphere."
msgstr "During the three-day trip, there are lectures, company presentations, as well as excursions and integration parties. ZOSIA traditionally takes place at the turn of February and March, sharing a passion for technology in a unique winter atmosphere."

